      "date": "2026-05-15T11:55:03.000Z",
      "title": "First quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹4.62 (vs ₹2.82 in 1Q 2025)",
      "body": "First quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.62 (up from ₹2.82 in 1Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.43b (up 15% from 1Q 2025). Net income: ₹42.4m (up 64% from 1Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.7% (up from 1.2% in 1Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 36% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 10% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
