      "date": "2026-03-12T11:47:27.000Z",
      "title": "Upcoming dividend of ₹3.00 per share",
      "body": "Eligible shareholders must have bought the stock before 16 March 2026. Payment date: 22 April 2026. Payout ratio is a comfortable 16% and this is well supported by cash flows. Trailing yield: 0.6%. Lower than top quartile of Indian dividend payers (1.6%). Lower than average of industry peers (0.8%).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
