      "date": "2026-02-25T11:48:16.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2025 earnings released: EPS: ₹18.93 (vs ₹21.29 in FY 2024)",
      "body": "Full year 2025 results: EPS: ₹18.93 (down from ₹21.29 in FY 2024). Revenue: ₹8.98b (up 1.2% from FY 2024). Net income: ₹173.8m (down 11% from FY 2024). Profit margin: 1.9% (down from 2.2% in FY 2024). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 2% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 12% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
